'''Magical Pokémon Journey: Hazel's Holiday''' is the nineteenth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]]. It contains the 29th and 30th chapters of the manga. The chapters originally released in this book were later rereleased as part of {{Vol|Magical Pokémon Journey|5}}. As a bonus, it contained a fold-out color poster which was not part of the regular volume.
__NOTOC__
==Blurb==
'''''HEALTH HAZARDS'''''

''After stepping on the bathroom scale, Bulbasaur is feeling a little self-conscious of its weight and now wants to go on a diet! To help the sullen Pokémon achieve its goal, Hazel takes Bulbasaur to a health spa for day of serious workout.'' 

''Then, it's Christmas time in the Pokémon world and there's only one present Hazel wants under her tree this year...Almond!''

